ding strength across multiple metals rather than remaining zinc-only. The core commitments: - **2X volume plan:** double total metal production from **1.1 million tonnes to 2 million tonnes over the next 5 years**, watch for slippage/approval cadence. - **Silver scale-up:** at 2 MTPA total capacity, silver output should exceed **1,500 tonnes/year** (vs 627 tonnes FY26 / ~700 tonnes cited at the AGM). India consumes 7,000, 8,000 tonnes of silver/year, zero exports.** - **Reserve & Resource:** target to grow metal R&R to **50 million tonnes** while sustaining **mine life beyond 25 years** even after the capacity doubling, executed through the exploration arm Hindmetal Exploration Services Pvt Ltd. - **Critical-minerals diversification:** blocks already secured for **tungsten, potash, rare-earth elements (monazite, UP, neodymium potential) and halite**. Management's explicit 5-year target: **add ~3 new metals to the portfolio** beyond zinc/lead/silver/cadmium/fertilizer, candidates named were neodymium, potash, tungsten, \"or any other like gold or copper blocks if we get anything in between.\" HZL intends to bid into the government's downstream magnet-manufacturing auctions too (India has no domestic rare-earth-magnet production capability today). - **Zinc Park:** a JV-style initiative with Tripura Group and CMR Green Energies to build \"India's first integrated zinc manufacturing ecosystem,\" pulling MSMEs into HZL's value chain. - **Cost leadership → renewables:** FY26 zinc cost of production (ex-royalty) hit a **5-year low of $959/tonne**, solar from Rajasthan, battery-backed for round-the-clock supply), since power is 40, $1,000/tonne). - No mention of a demerger of HZL from Vedanta, or of listing HZL's own subsidiaries, was made by management, see §5 (a shareholder explicitly proposed subsidiary listing/value-unlock and it went unaddressed in the CEO's reply).","trig":[]},"lm":"","m":253942,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":2,"prev_zone_vpe":0.3,"r":null,"s":"HINDZINC","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"559.0","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"18.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"0.0","vpe_zone_cumul_df":""},"t":""}},"s":"HINDZINC"}